{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Fubini--Study度量"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"“Fubini–Study 度量”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>复"},{"Local":{"url":"射影空间","text":"射影空间"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbb{C}P^n$ 上的 Hermite 度量. 它是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Kähler流形","text":"Kähler 流形"}},{"Plain":"的重要例子.</p>\n<p>在非齐次坐标 $\\displaystyle t^i = \\frac{z^i}{z^0}$ 下, Fubini–Study 度量可表示为\n$$\r\ng_{i\\bar j} = \\frac{\\partial ^2}{\\partial t^i \\partial \\overline{t^j}}\r\n\\log\\left( 1+ \\sum_{k=1}^n |t^k|^2\\right).\r\n$$\n此时"},{"Local":{"url":"基本形式","text":"基本形式"}},{"Plain":"可写为\n$$\r\n\\gamma = \\sqrt{-1} \\partial \\bar\\partial \\log \\left(1+ \\sum_{k=1}^n |t^k|^2\\right).\r\n$$\n它是线丛 $\\mathcal O(1)$ ("},{"Local":{"url":"超平面丛","text":"超平面丛"}},{"Plain":") 的第一"},{"Local":{"url":"陈类","text":"陈类"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}